From 7127330844512178c3872f3c3795eae990ae75ed Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Artem Butusov <art.sormy@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 00:47:22 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] media: meson: vdec: take the decoder from
 meson-sm1-codecs

Replace the staging decoder with meson-sm1-codecs at eb7a444, which adds
G12A-class H.264, HEVC and multi-instance MPEG-1/2 on top of it. Its
H.264 reference lists use v4l2-h264, so the driver selects V4L2_H264.

Link: https://github.com/ray38080289/meson-sm1-codecs
